# Place bundled fallback SVG icons here.
# One file per icon key, with dots replaced by underscores.
# Example: nav.home → nav_home.svg
#
# These files are the last line of defence when:
#   1. Network is unavailable
#   2. Disk cache has expired
#   3. Admin has not uploaded a custom icon yet
#
# The app will NEVER crash due to a missing icon — it falls back to
# Icons.image_not_supported_outlined as the absolute last resort.
